1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
In this video, we're going to show you how you can automate content discovery with Berberspeed Professional.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Now before you start, you'll need to populate the sitemap with some content before you can use the content discovery tool.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
If you'd like a tutorial on how to do this, you can view our documentation page on mapping the visible attack surface.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Now the first thing we're going to do with our populated sitemap is go to Target Sitemap and then find the root node for the domain where we want to discover the content.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:44,000
For the demo, I'm going to use gillandjuice.shop which is a deliberately vulnerable site which we at Portswigger have made to demonstrate vulnerability scanners.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:51,000
We're going to right click this root node and then go down to Engagement Tools and then Discover Content.

7
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Here, we're going to click Session is not running and this will start the content discovery session.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:07,000
You can see the tasks which are queued for the content discovery and as the content discovery tool discovers content, it will add it to the target sitemap.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:16,000
And you can also view the sitemap that the content discovery tool builds in the sitemap option here.

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
And that is how you automate content discovery within Berberspeed Professional.

